From a4c48599bdbbd931b64206a63673f7e7b0197e10 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 14:44:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] perf(dsv41): route SP prefill gather_many and row exchanges
 via sparknet

Route SPRows.gather_many (and gather_mxfp8) through the TP group's one-shot
RoCE communicator when all inputs fit within should_all_gather, packing small
trailing tensors (scales and top-k routes) into a single uint8 collective to
cut 4 all-gathers to 2.

Keep _tp_pynccl_comm() available alongside _tp_roce_comm() in
SPRows.project_exchange_rows so single-slice projections execute one full-row
GEMM overlapped on the side stream with then() (using one-shot RoCE when
eligible or PyNCCL otherwise) and multi-slice projections at >= 6,144 tokens
overlap sliced copy_self=False peer exchanges with local-block projection.
Also pass both send and recv tensors to should_exchange in SPRows.exchange_into.
